    <string name="settings_faq_btn_summary">What app can do and don\'t.</string>
    <string name="settings_faq_text"><![CDATA[This app downloads and shows data about earthquakes (till the last 120 earthquakes happened) taken from <a href="https://earthquake.usgs.gov/fdsnws/event/1/">USGS.gov</a> online service. It is not in any way related to USGS nor it is an app from them. <br><br>It has only informative purposes, the data about earthquakes are not in real time (check <a href="https://earthquake.usgs.gov/fdsnws/event/1/">USGS.gov site</a> for details). <br><br>So it is not intended to be a real time earthquake alert app, do not use it as a life saving app. <br><br>I&apos;m not responsible for any improper use of this app.

<br><br>In the map, it asks for user location permissions only for calculating the distance of earthquakes from the user, and the user&apos;s coordinates are stored for this purpose only. If location permissions are denied, it allows manual positioning by long-pressing on the map, without using GPS or any other localization system.

<br><br>If permissions are not granted and no manual localization is done, it uses the default location (Google location) and calculates earthquake distances from there.

<br><br>Hope you&apos;ll enjoy my app and find it useful. Check out my other apps and games on my site: <a href="http://www.indie-walkabout.eu">http://www.indie-walkabout.eu</a>.

<br><br>For suggestions, info, or bug reports, please contact me at <a href="mailto:indie.walkabout.1971@gmail.com">indie.walkabout.1971@gmail.com</a>]]></string>
